# oracle: pair lj/cut/dipole/long 3.5 with point charges INSIDE the Coulomb cutoff (charge-charge, charge-dipole and dipole-dipole real-space terms), cut down from examples/dipole/in.charge_dipole: 64 sc sites (4x4x4, density 0.30), charges +-0.5 alternating by id, random unit dipoles (dipole/random 5783), kspace_style pppm/dipole 1.0e-4 with kspace_modify gewald 0.45 mesh 12 12 12 order 5, fix nve/sphere update dipole, no thermostat, 40 steps of 0.002: pe, evdwl, ecoul, elong, press after the run and the per-atom forces, positions, dipoles and torques
# oracle-files: w170dq_charge_dipole_small_tq.dump
# measured with native LAMMPS (/home/roy/.local/bin/lmp, b332f28, installed DIPOLE and KSPACE packages): engine vs native fixture after 40 steps: max relative error below 8e-15 (bisected: the compare passes at rel = atomrel = filerel 8e-15 and fails at 5e-15, abs 1e-16; thermo, per-atom forces, positions, dipoles and torques together); engine time 1.9 s for the whole case (Node 24, loaded machine)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 atomrel=1e-8 filerel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
atom_style      hybrid sphere dipole
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
lattice         sc 0.30
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
set             group all diameter 1.0
set             group all density 1.0
variable        qi atom ((id%2)*2-1)*0.5
set             group all charge v_qi
set             group all dipole/random 5783 1.0
pair_style      lj/cut/dipole/long 3.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0
kspace_style    pppm/dipole 1.0e-4
kspace_modify   gewald 0.45 mesh 12 12 12 order 5
neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity        all create 1.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix             1 all nve/sphere update dipole
timestep        0.002
thermo          10
thermo_style    custom step pe evdwl ecoul elong press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g norm no
run             40
write_dump      all custom w170dq_charge_dipole_small_tq.dump id x y z mux muy muz tqx tqy tqz fx fy fz modify format float %.15g sort id
